{"product_id":"the-unlikely-hero-of-room-13b","title":"The Unlikely Hero of Room 13B","description":"\u003cp\u003eUnderstated and heart-warming this is a story of love and determination that shows how everyone can be a superhero in their own way. When adam meets robyn he is drawn to her almost before he can take a breath. He's determined to protect and defend her, to play batman to her robin, whatever the cost. But when you're fourteen and the everyday problems of dealing with divorced parents and step-siblings are supplemented by the challenges of ocd, it's hard to imagine yourself falling in love.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Teresa Toten\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781406362992\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 272\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45790881120409,"sku":"17RA-29781406362992","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ee1b0ca8f65_The_Unlikely_Hero_of_Room_13B_Teresa_Toten.jpg?v=1760460745","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-unlikely-hero-of-room-13b","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}